## Center Stone Guide: Lab Radiant Cut Diamonds

Vintage settings accept any grade of radiant cut center stone. For a vintage frame with milgrain and pavé detail, F or G color is the minimum recommended — the active setting draws the eye toward the center stone, and lower color grades become more noticeable in a busy vintage frame than in a plain solitaire.

