For buyers who want a larger presence in the vintage setting, the 1.5ct F-VVS1 at $1,510 adds significant face-up size for a $578 premium over the 1ct D-VVS1. In a vintage setting with active milgrain and pavé detail, a 1.5ct center stone commands the ring without being overpowered by the frame.

